Package: conformalRNN
Title: Conformal Prediction for Multi-Step Time Series Forecasting Using Vanilla RNNs
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Sehee", "Kim", , "seheekim@tamu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools for multi-horizon time series forecasting and uncertainty qunatification 
              using conformal prediction. Includes functions for constructing conformal prediction intervals
              and for working with RNN(recurrent neural network) forecasts.
License: GPL (>= 3)
